NULL, NULL, NULL, 'en', 'native_title_verified', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'INTER-NOISE and NOISE-CON Congress and Conference Proceedings', NULL, '270', '4', '7759', '7768', NULL, 'Institute of Noise Control Engineering (INCE)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '10.3397/in_2024_4004', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0736-2935', 'https://doi.org/10.3397/in_2024_4004', NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, 'grey', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'COMPLETE', 'VERIFIED', 'RESOLVED', NULL, NULL, 1, 'Conference proceedings (INTER-NOISE 2024). Peer-reviewed venue but proceedings-grade, not a journal article.', NULL, 'Expected the on-parameter DEM work that GAP-B01-002 names and batch 1 reported absent. Confirmed to exist, in the exact venue the gap register cites. Whether it carries a usable RT60 value for dementia care units is NOT established from the abstract alone and is not claimed here.', 'see search_executions exec 10-15 for this batch (verbatim, logged before screening)', NULL, ' || ADMITTED 2026-08-22, ref_id MINTED. Closes the retrieval half of GAP-B01-002 (P1: DEM carries 8 of 13 items on this slug and had no admission above PROXY). Conference proceedings, so graded grey/intrinsic -> T3 with grey_flag set. The gap does not close on admission alone - it closes when DEM carries an EXACT or PARTIAL graded admission, which this provides, but the underlying evidence remains T3.', '2026-08-22 05:28', 'session_2026-08-22-research-batch-02-room-acoustic-performance', '2026-08-22', 'session_2026-08-22-research-batch-02-room-acoustic-performance', 'crossref', NULL, 1, NULL, '7759-7768', 10, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'intrinsic', 'pending', 'pending', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'tool', NULL);
